      "default": "Frequently<br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 139, 216);\">Asked Questions</span>"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_8eaaa359_label",
      "label": "Accordion.Header — Label",
      "default": "Is ThePhotoStick® Omni X&nbsp;easy to use?"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_9229b080_value",
      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "Yes, getting started with ThePhotoStick Omni X is incredibly easy! Please note, however, that it will take some time for ThePhotoStick Omni X to find each of your photos and safely back them up. This time can vary depending on how many photos you have, the size of your files, and the type of device you are using. But the great thing about ThePhotoStick Omni X is that anyone can use it, no matter how comfortable they are with technology!<br><br>Check out our User Guide for more information on getting started with ThePhotoStick Omni X. We also offer live customer support if you have any questions or difficulties: support@thephotostick.com"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_80ddf54c_label",
      "label": "Accordion.Header — Label",
      "default": "Which devices work with ThePhotoStick® Omni X?"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_613d4b67_value",
      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "ThePhotoStick Omni X works with all modern computers, smartphones, and tablets right out of the box.<br><br>It's also compatible with all Windows, Android, and Mac Operating Systems:<br>- Windows: Windows 7 SP1 and Later<br>- Apple: iOS and iPadOS 13.0 and Later<br>- Android: 8.0 and Later<br><br>For more up-to-date information regarding ThePhotoStick compatibility, we recommend viewing our System Requirements page. "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_677e93ca_label",
      "label": "Accordion.Header — Label",
      "default": "How many photos can I store on ThePhotoStick® Omni X?"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_e72e0b94_value",
      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "Approximate Number of Photos Stored on ThePhotoStick Omni X:<br><br>32GB - 12,800 photos<br>64GB - 25,600 photos<br>128GB - 51,200 photos<br>256GB - 102,400 photos<br><br><em>*Please note that storage capacity per GB listed above is approximate, and exact storage amounts vary depending on file type and size. For more in-depth information regarding ThePhotoStick Omni X, check out our Official User Guide.</em> "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_94630010_label",
      "label": "Accordion.Header — Label",
      "default": "What photo and video file types can ThePhotoStick® Omni X&nbsp;detect?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_1b4e34a9_label",
      "label": "Accordion.Header — Label",
      "default": "Does ThePhotoStick® Omni X&nbsp;need to install anything on my computer?"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_983c411d_value",
      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "<strong>For computers (Mac or PC):</strong> ThePhotoStick Omni X does not need to install anything on your computer, nor does it require anything to be already installed on your computer.<br><br>It comes with everything it needs. Just simply plug it into an available USB slot, and you’re ready to get started.<br><br><strong>For phones (Android or iOS):</strong> ThePhotoStick Omni X offers a FREE app that allows you to back up, view, and organize your photos with ease.<br><br>There are no monthly charges or download costs for using the app – just download it and follow the on-screen instructions to easily get started. "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_1debd3de_label",
      "label": "Accordion.Header — Label",
      "default": "Can I use ThePhotoStick® Omni X&nbsp;as an ongoing backup solution?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_f7e9b2f7_value",
      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "Yes, it’s a great backup solution! Many people use ThePhotoStick Omni X&nbsp;for&nbsp;weekly backups to make sure they are continually protecting their memories. "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_f70e1e0e_label",
      "label": "Accordion.Header — Label",
      "default": "Does ThePhotoStick® Omni X&nbsp;come with tech support?"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_714fbc8f_value",
      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "<strong></strong>Of course! Visit our website, thephotostick.com, and click the gray circle near the bottom right corner of the page to begin chatting with a member of our Support Team.<br><br>Live Chat available Monday-Saturday, 8am-8pm PST "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_8fe1179f_label",
      "label": "Accordion.Header — Label",
      "default": "How does the 30-Day Money Back Guarantee work?"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_57353cae_value",
      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "<strong></strong>We offer a no-hassle, 30-Day Money Back Guarantee. If you're not 100% satisfied with your purchase from ThePhotoStick, our team is here to assist you with a return. We want you to be happy!<br><br>If you are not completely satisfied with your order, please get in touch with us&nbsp;at returns@thephotostick.com, and we'd be happy to facilitate your return and refund. For more information regarding our return process, check out our Returns and Refunds page.   "
    },
